<title>CANADA: RESEARCH ALERT - Imperial Oil cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Imperial Oil cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities downgraded Imperial Oil Ltd to hold from buy, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was unchanged at 47-1/2 in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
